{
 "source": "geneva",
 "book": "1SA",
 "chapter": 1,
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.1",
   "range": "1SA.1.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "18c519d3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.1#p1-18c519d3",
     "text": "There were two Ramatus, so that in this city in mount Ephraim were Zophim, that is, the learned men and prophets.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Ramathaimzophim"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.3",
   "range": "1SA.1.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "bd67c03f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.3#p1-bd67c03f",
     "text": "For the ark was there at that time.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "Shiloh"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.5",
   "range": "1SA.1.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "2c176b5c",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.5#p1-2c176b5c",
     "text": "Some read, a portion with a hearty cheer.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "portion"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.8",
   "range": "1SA.1.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "eff9b5b3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.8#p1-eff9b5b3",
     "text": "Let this comfort you, that I love you no less than if you had many children.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "sons"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.9",
   "range": "1SA.1.9",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "71056d62",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.9#p1-71056d62",
     "text": "That is of the house where the ark was.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "temple of the LORD"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.18",
   "range": "1SA.1.18",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8c5c48bd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.18#p1-8c5c48bd",
     "text": "That is, pray to the Lord for me.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "grace in thy sight"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.19",
   "range": "1SA.1.19",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "93b69777",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.19#p1-93b69777",
     "text": "According to her petition.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "remembered her"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.21",
   "range": "1SA.1.21",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c78bd4fd",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.21#p1-c78bd4fd",
     "text": "This Elkanah was a Levite, 1Ch 6:27, and as some write once a year they were accustomed to appear before the Lord with their families.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "Elkanah",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "1Ch 6:27",
       "ref": "1CH.6.27"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.23",
   "range": "1SA.1.23",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "c1afbbe0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.23#p1-c1afbbe0",
     "text": "Because her prayer took effect, therefore it was called the Lord's promise.",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "word"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.26",
   "range": "1SA.1.26",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "68d17afe",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.26#p1-68d17afe",
     "text": "That is, most certainly.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "soul liveth"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/1SA.1.28",
   "range": "1SA.1.28",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "8d991658",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/1SA.1.28#p1-8d991658",
     "text": "Meaning, Eli gave thanks to God for her.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "worshipped the LORD there"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
